(text "TWO CURRENT-LIMITED 5V ENCODER SUPPLIES - ENGINEERING BLOCK r0.1" (at 17.78 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.1 2.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "18dbeed6-1311-56d1-8a22-d2c2e0d1dc66"))
(text "TPS2553DBVR-1: DBV/SOT-23-6, not DRV. Exact receiver net names retained. No main supply/input protection, controller or board layout." (at 17.78 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "53a3042f-c686-5eb4-a1c2-f2c37af26fd3"))
(text "110k RILIM including 1%+150K/100ppm allowance: 207.445–283.605mA.\nTwo simultaneous pre-latch limits: 0.567210A plus switch supply current.\nLedger 0.4A is normal encoder load, not the fault budget. No full power budget approval." (at 17.78 304.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3ad05628-6764-51bf-803f-e06df1d10bb4"))
(text "Overcurrent/reverse events latch off after deglitch; EN toggle or power cycle clears latch.\nTHERMAL SHUTDOWN CAN AUTO-RETRY, including the -1 part. External fault-inhibit policy is missing.\nA high EN retained across power return can energize the port. No automatic-restart prevention is claimed." (at 236.22 304.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e50f24e8-08b7-597a-a4f1-6ff91073483f"))
(text "Not a universal reverse-current barrier: reverse current can flow before protection responds.\nNo guarantee for 24V/reversed wiring, surge or system ESD. Board/cable faults need qualification.\n100k output bleed is passive; no active discharge or guaranteed de-energization time." (at 17.78 353.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "26fa4698-8afa-5412-bf2a-9a7a0cfb0fd7"))
(text "EN and FAULT interfaces target 0–3.6V, shared ground; partial-power/backfeed tests remain open.\nDo not infer healthy power from an unasserted FAULT, especially with the switch/host unpowered.\nCapacitor MPN/effective capacitance and startup/load tests are pending. Unreleased engineering source." (at 236.22 353.06 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bef9100e-0cc3-5c46-b11d-43d9e5c63b91"))
)
